  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "Chapter Ban 700 had formerly been titled “General Provisions Applicable to Savings Banks, Trust Companies and Other Depository Institutions.” The last provision in that chapter expired 5-20-06. The filings affecting the former Ban 700 included the following documents:\n\n#2718, effective 5-21-84, EXPIRED 5-21-90\n\n#6277, effective 6-27-96, EXPIRED 6-27-04\n\n#6279, effective 6-27-96, EXPIRED 6-27-04\n\n#6388, effective 11-27-96, EXPIRED 11-27-04\n\n#6637, effective 11-27-97, EXPIRED 11-27-05\n\n#6751, effective 5-20-98, EXPIRED 5-20-06",
